"""Fixed Telegram message templates. Pure. Never generated by an LLM.

Emergency/warning sentences are copied verbatim from docs/red-scripts.md (RED-MOTHER,
RED-BABY, AMBER-MOTHER, AMBER-BABY, FAMILY-ALERT); the framing around them is fixed text.
English is the master. Kannada drafts are marked "needs native check" and are NOT sent
until TRANSLATIONS_APPROVED is set by the content owner.

Minimal data: family chats get status and instructions only. No transcripts, no full phone
numbers, nothing beyond the danger sign in plain words.
"""

from __future__ import annotations

